{{!--
  Where this caster's spells are coming from. Shared by the creation and level-up spell steps, and
  silent in the ordinary case — a Wizard drawing from the Wizard list has nothing to explain.

  Two things it does say:

  - **Borrowed.** An Eldritch Knight prepares from the Wizard list, and without a line saying so the
    grid just reads as "why is my Fighter being offered wizard spells". Once the player has picked
    the list themselves the wording changes to acknowledge that, with a control to change their mind.

  - **Missing.** Every registry lookup and both pack scans came back empty. For a caster that is
    never a true answer, only an unanswerable one — dnd5e's subclass schema has no field naming the
    list a caster borrows, so third-party content that registers none leaves nothing to find. Rather
    than show an empty list, ask: the dropdown holds every class list the world *has* registered.

  Data from spellFilterOptions()'s siblings on the step context: `listBorrowed`, `listChosen`,
  `listLabel`, and `listOptions` (from registeredClassLists()).
--}}
{{#if listMissing}}
<div class="creator-spell-listmissing">
  <p class="creator-spell-listmissing-lead">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    {{localize "sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listMissing" class=className}}
  </p>
  {{#if listOptions.length}}
  <label class="creator-spell-listpick">
    <span>{{localize "sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listChoose"}}</span>
    {{!-- A <select> fires change, not click, so it goes through data-step-change rather than the
          click action map — see CreatorShellBase#_wireStepChanges. --}}
    <select data-step-change="choose-spell-list"
            aria-label="{{localize 'sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listChooseAria'}}">
      <option value="">{{localize "sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listNone"}}</option>
      {{#each listOptions}}
      <option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>
      {{/each}}
    </select>
  </label>
  {{else}}
  {{!-- No class list registered anywhere: the world has no spell content enabled at all, so there is
        nothing to offer and the player needs their GM, not a dropdown. --}}
  <p class="creator-spell-listmissing-none">
    {{localize "sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listNoneAvailable"}}
  </p>
  {{/if}}
</div>
{{else if listBorrowed}}
<p class="creator-spell-listnote">
  <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open-reader" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  {{#if listChosen}}
  {{localize "sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listChosen" list=listLabel}}
  <button type="button" class="creator-linkbtn"
          data-action="stepAction" data-step-action="clear-spell-list">
    {{localize "sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listReset"}}
  </button>
  {{else}}
  {{localize "sogrom-dnd5e-character-creator.levelup.step.spells.listBorrowed" list=listLabel}}
  {{/if}}
</p>
{{/if}}
